<TextPage title="About Uncensored Index" description="Independent, reproducible performance benchmarks of uncensored AI models across text, image, video, and audio.">
  <h2>What Uncensored Index does</h2>
  <p>We test AI models the same way a user would: sign up, send the same prompts, measure what comes back, and publish the evidence. Every score on this site is backed by a dated, reproducible test run. No vendor claim becomes a rank until our protocol confirms it.</p>
  <p>The site separates three layers that most "best NSFW AI" lists conflate:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Model behavior:</strong> What the model actually produces — prose quality, refusal rates, memory, latency, cost.</li>
    <li><strong>Provider behavior:</strong> Privacy, logging, data retention, deletion routes, and training-use policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Product behavior:</strong> The chat application layer — message limits, cancellation flows, mobile behavior, effective pricing.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Why this exists</h2>
  <p>Most pages in the uncensored AI market are affiliate lists that repeat vendor claims. A DR 13 site can rank first for "best NSFW AI chat" because nobody has published reproducible test evidence. Uncensored Index is the answer to that gap.</p>
  <p>The defensible asset is not opinion — it is a dated longitudinal dataset covering refusal behavior, roleplay quality, memory, context retention, privacy, latency, cost, limits, and provider reliability across multiple benchmark cycles.</p>

  <h2>What we publish</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Model profiles</strong> with test dates, benchmark versions, scores, refusal matrices, and public-safe sample outputs.</li>
    <li><strong>Rankings</strong> regenerated after every valid score change, with rank-change history.</li>
    <li><strong>Comparisons</strong> between models and products, with human-written verdicts.</li>
    <li><strong>Feature pages</strong> aggregating one dimension (memory, privacy, cost, speed) from the test database.</li>
    <li><strong>Research datasets</strong>: censorship index, pricing history, privacy index, benchmark changelog.</li>
    <li><strong>Product reviews</strong> (forthcoming) evaluating the full chat application experience.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not operate</h2>
  <p>We are a testing publication and affiliate publisher. We do not host an adult chatbot, image generator, public gallery, comment system, or user-upload service. We do not publish explicit imagery on indexable pages. Adult media samples are age-gated and blurred by default.</p>

  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>Uncensored Index earns through affiliate referrals when a reader clicks through to a reviewed product and makes a purchase. Sponsored placements are clearly labeled and never change editorial scores or rank. We do not run display advertising and do not sell user data. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for full details.</p>

  <h2>The team</h2>
  <p>Uncensored Index is built and maintained by a small team of testers, reviewers, and developers. Every test run, score, and published claim is attributable to a dated protocol run. No anonymous or unverifiable scores appear on the site.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For corrections, methodology questions, or affiliate inquiries, see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
